=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n来吧\n终于等到了\n新的对决！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n第二战！\n<br>\n明日叶粉末 vs 朝日超爽啤酒！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/002-80f186df7a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/002-80f186df7a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n双方正互相瞪着呢（笑）\n<br>\n<br>\n然后\n分析了昨天失败的原因\n这次\n试着改变了制作方法！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n首先是……\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/003-588c5e67a8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/003-588c5e67a8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n啤酒倒进去！！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n怎么样！！\n这下肯定能成功！\n<br>\n<br>\n然后……\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/004-edebf81a89.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/004-edebf81a89.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n明日叶粉末！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n赢了！\n<br>\n<br>\n这样就肯定能做出\n真正的明日叶啤酒了！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n慢慢搅拌……\n<br>\n咦？！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/005-46b4d0e4e0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/005-46b4d0e4e0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n咦咦咦？！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/006-67ee9eecc3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/006-67ee9eecc3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n咦咦咦咦咦——？！！！\n泡沫不停地冒出来！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n简直是彻底的化学反应（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n换个意义来说还挺有趣的（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n味道怎么样？\n是朝日超爽啤酒哦！\n是朝日超爽啤酒哦！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/007-68c142ec34.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/007-68c142ec34.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哇——！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n分离得一塌糊涂！！\n和昨天一样……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n难……难喝……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n看看这化学反应（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/008-237127fb92.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/008-237127fb92.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n完全搞不懂（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            不过……\n走到这一步\n我好像终于有点明白了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶粉末放太多了（笑）\n↑\n现在才发现吗！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n第三战！\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶粉末 vs 惠比寿啤酒！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/009-816023ce4c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/009-816023ce4c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶粉末\n少放一点少放一点！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/010-3c32a8da04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/010-3c32a8da04.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n搅拌\n\n泡沫咕嘟咕嘟冒出来后\n先等一会儿\n等啤酒平静下来\n再继续搅拌！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n（↑偶然发现的！）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n锵锵——！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/011-3914ea99e2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/011-3914ea99e2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n怎么样！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n颜色相当漂亮！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这\n\n<br>\n\n\n简直就是\n\n<br>\n\n\n简直就是八丈岛的\n明日叶啤酒吧？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/012-992eb754f7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/012-992eb754f7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（杯子有点脏，抱歉啦）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n味道也正是\n明日叶啤酒！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于……完成了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于露出笑容了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶啤酒\n最棒了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（还好没进入第三天……\n差点就糟了（笑））\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带）\n明日叶荞麦面和乌冬面\n我也买来当自己的伴手礼了！\n给忘了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n这两样也很推荐作为八丈岛伴手礼！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/013-ee2ad184b0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/013-ee2ad184b0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">みなさま</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">お待ちどうさま（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">あしたば粉末で</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">あしたばビールを作ろうの会</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">会長のマスダです（笑）</div>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/001-320d80543e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/001-320d80543e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\nさあ\nいよいよやってきました\n新たなる対決が！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n第２戦！\n<br>\nあしたば粉末 vs プレミアムモルツ！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/002-80f186df7a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/002-80f186df7a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n両者 睨み合ってます（笑）\n<br>\n<br>\nそして\n昨日の失敗を分析し\n今回は\n作り方を変えてみました！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nまずは・・・\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/003-588c5e67a8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/003-588c5e67a8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nビールを注ぐ！！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nどうだっ！！\nこれできっとうまく行くはず！\n<br>\n<br>\nそして・・・\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/004-edebf81a89.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/004-edebf81a89.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\nあしたば粉末！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n勝った！\n<br>\n<br>\nこれで完全なる\nあしたばビールができたはず！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nゆっくり混ぜる・・・\n<br>\nええ？！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/005-46b4d0e4e0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/005-46b4d0e4e0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nえええっ？！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/006-67ee9eecc3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/006-67ee9eecc3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nえええええっっ？！！！\n泡が立ちまくる！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n完全なる化学反応（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n違う意味で楽しいけど（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n味はどうだ？！\nプレミアムモルツだよ！\nプレミアムモルツだよ！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/007-68c142ec34.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/007-68c142ec34.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nうわー！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n分離しまくり！！\n昨日と同じだ・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマ・・マズイ・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n見よこの化学反応（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/008-237127fb92.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/008-237127fb92.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n意味わからん（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            しかし・・・\nここまで来て\n何となく分かって来た！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたば粉末が多いってことを（笑）\n↑\nいまかよ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n第３戦！\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたば粉末 vs エビスビール！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/009-816023ce4c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/009-816023ce4c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたば粉末\n少なめ少なめ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/010-3c32a8da04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/010-3c32a8da04.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n混ぜて\n\n泡がぶくぶくしたら\n少し待って\nビールが落ち着いたら\nまた混ぜる！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n（↑偶然発見！）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nババーン！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/011-3914ea99e2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/011-3914ea99e2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどーだっ！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nかなり綺麗な色！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれは\nまさしく\n\n<br>\n\n\nまさしく八丈島の\nあしたばビールでは？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/012-992eb754f7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/012-992eb754f7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（グラス汚くて申し訳ないけど）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n味はまさしく\nあしたばビール！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nついに・・・完成！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nようやく笑顔\n出ました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたばビール\n最高です！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（3日目に突入しなくて良かった・・・\nあぶねー（笑））\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\nあしたば蕎麦とうどんも\n自分お土産に買ってました！\n忘れてたw\n\n<br>\n\n\nこちらも八丈島お土産に\nオススメ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/013-ee2ad184b0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2579219/013-ee2ad184b0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>"}}